  "description": {
   "en": "“Assassinate Takeda Harunobu.”\n\nUnder that order, a young man, raised as a spy without a name, had his face altered to look just like that of Harunobu. He infiltrates the Takeda family's home in order to accomplish his mission, but the real Harunobu turns out to have a secret, too…?\n\nA Warring States Era tragicomedy!"
